msgstr "Custom link to open the settings: class <code>marmal-cookies-nastaveni</code>, a link to <code>#nastaveni-cookies</code> or the shortcode <code>[marmal_cookies_nastaveni]</code>. In scripts: <code>MarmalCookies.souhlas('analyticke')</code>, event <code>marmal:cookies</code>. In Google Tag Manager: event <code>marmal_consent</code> and dataLayer variables <code>marmal_analyticke</code>, <code>marmal_marketingove</code>, <code>marmal_preferencni</code>."

